<section id="apa-itu-tidyverse" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="apa-itu-tidyverse">Apa itu Tidyverse?</h2>
<p>Tidyverse adalah kumpulan package R yang dirancang untuk data science. Package utamanya meliputi <code>dplyr</code>, <code>ggplot2</code>, <code>tidyr</code>, <code>readr</code>, dan <code>purrr</code>.</p>
</section>
<section id="memuat-data" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="memuat-data">Memuat Data</h2>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb1" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode r code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb1-1"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">library</span>(tidyverse)</span>
<span id="cb1-2"></span>
<span id="cb1-3">df <span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">read_csv</span>(<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"data.csv"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb1-4"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">glimpse</span>(df)</span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
